Z||000000||LT1 Chop Top||09-12-2001||10:10 PM||||I just called the organizer of the Pontiac open car show at Rolling Oaks mall, and he said it is still on.<BR>Hope as many of our Texas Fiero owners can make it!<P> When:  Sunday, September 16, 2001  <BR>  9:00 AM To 4:00 PM  ( Canada Central : Saskatchewan ) <BR>  <BR> Where:  Rolling Oaks Mall <BR>  <BR> Comments:  Rolling Oaks Mall is located on the NE side of town at the intersection of Loop 1604 and Nacodoches Road.<BR>Registration is from 900 am to 1130 am with awards scheduled at 400 pm<BR>Entry fee is 20 bucks as long as it is recieved by the 9th of September and 25 bucks after that date<BR> <BR>Mail entries to:<BR> <BR>SCTC Pontiac/Oakland Club<BR>C/O Jay Lord<BR>30860 Setting Sun<BR>Bulverde TX 78163<BR> <BR>You can also call Jay for more information at 830-438-2878<BR> <BR>Make checks payable to SCTC Pontiac/Oakland Club<BR> <BR> <BR>||||reg||1
